{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"猜了又不敢认，心一直绷着；那点亲切再靠近，他只想静静待一会儿。\",\n          \"key\": \"紧绷后的喘息\",\n          \"follows\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"刚松下一点，刚才那下几乎能认出的感觉又牵起猜测，他舍不得这片刻安稳。\",\n          \"key\": \"猜测又牵回来\",\n          \"follows\": true\n        }\n      ],\n      \"because\": [\n        {\n          \"item\": 1,\n          \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"改写\",\n          \"why\": \"上一段他对那点似乎能辨认的细节反复猜测，却始终不敢认，心口一直收紧。此刻再感到亲切，他首先想要的是靠着它歇息片刻。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"item\": 2,\n          \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"唤起\",\n          \"why\": \"上一段那点近乎能辨认的细节已经重新勾起他的追问。眼下稍一安静，他又惦记那究竟是什么，使刚得到的松快很快受到打扰。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"center_relation\": \"还说不清\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"那点几乎能辨认的熟悉感，会在他短暂安稳时再次勾起追问。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 9,\n      \"why\": \"紧接上一段猜了又不敢认的紧绷，短暂的亲切可以成为一次喘息，而尚未放下的具体线索又解释了为什么这次安稳如此短促。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选7\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"那一下熟悉得像从前随手就有的亲近；如今再感到它，他想细细体会那种平常。\",\n          \"key\": \"想重温寻常\",\n          \"follows\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"可那种随手可得的亲近或许只在从前，他才暖了一会儿就心酸，舍不得它离开。\",\n          \"key\": \"为寻常心酸\",\n          \"follows\": true\n        }\n      ],\n      \"because\": [\n        {\n          \"item\": 1,\n          \"from\": \"S07-1\",\n          \"rel\": \"改写\",\n          \"why\": \"上一段，那份亲切突然带上了从前寻常动作般的熟悉感，使他猝不及防。如今再次感到它，刚才令他心冷的那点寻常，反而使他想多体会片刻。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"item\": 2,\n          \"from\": \"S07-1\",\n          \"rel\": \"限制\",\n          \"why\": \"那一下像寻常动作的熟悉感，也曾使他担心自己想要的亲近只能留在从前。眼下重新尝到温暖，这个担忧使他觉得，曾经仿佛随手可得的东西，如今连短短的贴近都令人舍不得。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"center_relation\": \"还说不清\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"那份像从前寻常亲近的熟悉感，如今使他感到温柔的心酸。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"上一段新出现的寻常生活质感，为这一段的温柔与不舍提供了具体缘由，使他的反应从猝然心冷转为想细细感受，却也因可能回不去而心酸。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选6\",\n        \"候选9\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "113d4d7a-bf03-4ba2-a8ed-107b0126ee9f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T162035220011Z", "elapsed_seconds": 531.125, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T16:29:26.352194+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "257e09589ba884cf49960439a3feb71b96bc78e797df90a18e7047c654cfdaff", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T162035220011Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "8cd508a34bdb77d6cc94b6b1a2e1a02fb7ed15184c9408ce35bdc64a1ac7